import{_ as t,o as n,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 834 | Transcended Ones and Education · Overview — The Transcended One's Education System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 834 | Transcended Ones and Education · Overview — The Transcended One's Education System","no":834,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Education","Education System","Symbiotic Education","Selfless Dao"],"related":["37-Symbiotic Education System","08-Every-Person-Has-a-Path Guarantee System","781-The Transcended One's Myriad-Rank Education Duty","720-Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0834_模块4-超脱者与教育-总论.md","filePath":"en/0834_模块4-超脱者与教育-总论.md"}`),i={name:"en/0834_模块4-超脱者与教育-总论.md"};function s(r,e,d,l,h,u){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-834-transcended-ones-and-education-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-education-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 834 | Transcended Ones and Education · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Education System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-834-transcended-ones-and-education-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-education-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 834 | Transcended Ones and Education · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Education System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 37, 08, 781, 720</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-transcended-one-s-education-system-is-the-master-valve-of-myriad-ranks-have-a-path" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the transcended one&#39;s education system is the master valve of &quot;Myriad Ranks have a path&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-transcended-one-s-education-system-is-the-master-valve-of-myriad-ranks-have-a-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the transcended one&#39;s education system is the master valve of &quot;Myriad Ranks have a path&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The strongest in the old world never ran education. His Dao came through sudden enlightenment; written out, others cannot understand; his experience was forged between life and death; spoken out, others cannot learn. So Myriad Ranks could only &quot;gaze at the imperial visage,&quot; guessing on their own — what they guessed was mostly predation. Heng Yuan Zhou completely flips this: <strong>the strongest not only must teach, but must build teaching itself into a self-consistent, replicable, perpetually iterating system.</strong> This entry is the &quot;Transcended Ones and Education&quot; sub-theme overview, answering one overall question: what does the transcended one&#39;s education system look like as a whole, what does it rely on to run, and why is it the anti-predation civilization&#39;s first public defense line.</p><p>Six top-level axioms simultaneously take the stage: <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires education not hide private things, not monopolize, not use knowledge as a private tool; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires education open to 99% of all Myriad-Rank beings, regardless of race, gender, origin, or life form; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires education&#39;s ultimate purpose be lifting Myriad Ranks forward into evolution, not cultivating a few solo-flying strong ones; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires education content and process be traceable and supervisable, not disturb Myriad Ranks&#39; causality under education&#39;s name; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires this education system itself be law-level self-consistent setting, infinitely scalable without book-eating or unfinished ending.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-transcended-one-s-education-is-a-system-not-a-few-teachers" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Transcended One&#39;s Education Is a &quot;System,&quot; Not &quot;A Few Teachers&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-transcended-one-s-education-is-a-system-not-a-few-teachers" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Transcended One&#39;s Education Is a &quot;System,&quot; Not &quot;A Few Teachers&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world also had teachers — sect elders, family elders, secret-realm inheritors. But that was not a system; it was master-apprentice private transmission: one master takes three to five disciples; disciples each take three to five; the Dao goes with the person; the person dies, the Dao extinguishes. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended-one education is called a &quot;system&quot; because it simultaneously has four traits the old world never had:</p><ol><li><strong>Textbook-ification</strong>: every step of the transcended one&#39;s insight, every breakthrough, every pitfall must be organized into structured teaching material — with prerequisites, steps, cases, assessment, applicable boundaries, opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao. Textbooks are not quotation-style, but reusable engineering documents.</li><li><strong>Post-ification</strong>: teaching is not the transcended one&#39;s amateur good deed, but his legal post duty as a Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm officeholder (see entry 720 &quot;Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post&quot;). Apprentice-taking quotas, teaching hours, textbook output all count into civilizational-weight assessment.</li><li><strong>Network-ization</strong>: education does not depend on some famous teacher. Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision networks every transcended one&#39;s teaching data, students&#39; growth curves, textbook revision records, forming a retrievable, iterable, correctable public-knowledge network.</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank-ization</strong>: textbooks and teaching methods must adapt for Myriad Ranks&#39; five lineages (carbon-based matter lineage, energy-condensed lineage, mechanical-constructed lineage, consciousness-information lineage, hybrid-mutated lineage) each life form; may not only teach the carbon-based human set.</li></ol><p>Four traits together, the Dao no longer &quot;goes with the person&quot; — <strong>the Dao is deposited into the system; people may rotate; the system is perpetual.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-the-education-system-s-four-layer-depth" tabindex="-1">II. The Education System&#39;s Four-Layer Depth <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-education-system-s-four-layer-depth" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Education System&#39;s Four-Layer Depth&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Benchmarking Symbiotic Education System (Document 37)&#39;s four-level structure, the transcended-one education system overlays a &quot;hyper-multiverse depth,&quot; forming four layers:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>Object</th><th>Transcended-One Intervention</th><th>Correspondence with Nine Realms</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Enlightenment layer</td><td>All Myriad-Rank underage beings</td><td>Provide free public textbooks, remote teaching</td><td>Sense Realm — Condensed Realm</td></tr><tr><td>Foundation layer</td><td>Those who have completed enlightenment</td><td>System-compatibility assessment, public cultivation sites open</td><td>Transform Realm — Law Realm</td></tr><tr><td>Advanced layer</td><td>High-potential cultivators</td><td>One-on-one mentoring, deep law research</td><td>Dao Origin Realm — Dao Integration Realm</td></tr><tr><td>Hyper-multiverse lineage layer</td><td>Would-be transcended ones</td><td>On-post mentoring, cross-plane actual combat, civilizational-weight assessment</td><td>Boundary-Breaking Realm — Origin Realm — Multiverse Realm — Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The first three layers are &quot;bringing Myriad Ranks through the door&quot;; the fourth layer is &quot;bringing later-comers into new transcended ones.&quot; Without the fourth layer, the transcended-one ranks cannot be perpetual; without the first three layers, the fourth layer is a tower in the air — it must grow from Myriad Ranks&#39; universal-evolution soil. This is the collective ascension axiom&#39;s educational expression: <strong>the strong do not ascend alone, but also teach Myriad Ranks the &quot;method of ascending.&quot;</strong></p><h2 id="iii-how-the-education-system-cuts-off-the-short-cut-inner-demon-s-student-source" tabindex="-1">III. How the Education System Cuts Off the &quot;Short-Cut Inner Demon&quot;&#39;s Student Source <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-how-the-education-system-cuts-off-the-short-cut-inner-demon-s-student-source" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. How the Education System Cuts Off the &quot;Short-Cut Inner Demon&quot;&#39;s Student Source&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended-one education system&#39;s most hidden yet critical function is guarding against beings&#39; origin greed · short-cut inner demon. Myriad-Rank beings on the cultivation road are most easily tempted by &quot;quick results,&quot; &quot;devouring others,&quot; &quot;back doors.&quot; When the right road is clear enough, easy enough, fair enough, the short-cut inner demon&#39;s temptation drops sharply.</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou therefore adheres to one iron rule: <strong>if transcended ones do not open the door, predators will open it; if transcended ones do not teach the right road, evil roads will grow weeds.</strong> The education system&#39;s completeness directly determines the short-cut inner demon&#39;s student-source scale. This is not a moral call, but civilizational-security engineering — the thicker the textbooks, the more mentors, the lower the threshold, the fewer &quot;believers&quot; predators can dig.</p><h2 id="iv-the-education-system-and-alaya-network-multi-layer-supervision" tabindex="-1">IV. The Education System and Alaya Network + Multi-Layer Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-education-system-and-alaya-network-multi-layer-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Education System and Alaya Network + Multi-Layer Supervision&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Education itself is also a cross-plane, cross-generation causal operation, so it must accept the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s constraints. The transcended one&#39;s teaching content, apprentice records, textbook revisions all leave traces under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision:</p><ul><li>Who taught, whom, what textbooks used, whether the student went astray, all traceable;</li><li>Once a textbook is revised, the old version is archived and queryable, eliminating &quot;plot-hijacking-the-setting&quot;-style temporary course changes;</li><li>If a student is found to be taking a predatory route, the system automatically traces his textbook source and mentor-guidance records, cutting off the pollution chain;</li><li>Teaching-ethics review: prohibits any transcended one under the name &quot;teaching according to aptitude&quot; from actually privately hoarding knowledge.</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the transcended one&#39;s insights if not textbook-ified dissipate with the individual; textbook-ification lets one insight serve Myriad Ranks for ten-thousand years, eliminating great-talent-wasted</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: education not hiding private things directly seals the &quot;knowledge monopoly&quot; predatory path; if you do not teach, others will snatch by predatory means</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo favor system transmitted the Dao only to Tang Luo alone, relying on Gu Chensha&#39;s grace, ceiling locked; Heng Yuan Zhou requires transcended ones textbook-ify the Dao then open it to all Myriad-Rank beings; the education system perpetually iterates</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: four-layer depth explicitly requires developing adapted textbooks for five lineages&#39; each life form, ensuring 99% coverage</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: all textbooks, teaching methods, assessment standards open through the Selfless Dao network-wide, zero threshold, zero fee, zero discrimination; part of the &quot;basic manuals → Sacrifice Dao → multiverse-grade → Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&quot; full-open chain&#39;s educational segment</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s education system is the four words &quot;Myriad Ranks have a path&quot;&#39;s master valve. It deposits the strongest one&#39;s insights into Myriad Ranks&#39; reusable public knowledge; upgrades master-apprentice private transmission into a post-ified, network-ized, Myriad-Rank-ized perpetual project. When the strongest must be a teacher, being a teacher must be a system, being a system must be supervised, civilization will not hand &quot;evolution&quot; back to predation and monopoly. This is the transcended one&#39;s orthodox definition at the education dimension.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/37-共生教育体系.html">Entry 37 · Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Every-Person-Has-a-Path Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/781_模块4-万族-超脱者的教育责任.html">Entry 781 · The Transcended One&#39;s Myriad-Rank Education Duty</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/720_模块4-超脱者培训与传承岗.html">Entry 720 · Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=t(i,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
